# UI Components & Theme

## Available shared components (`ijs-ui-components-lib`)
- `LoadingContent()` — full-screen loading spinner
- `ErrorContent(error, onRetry)` — error state with retry button
- `FleetDateField(rawValue, onRawValueChange, label, placeholder)` — date input DD-MM-YYYY
- `DateRangePickerDialog(isVisible, startDate, endDate, ...)` — date range dialog
- `ShimmerEffect()` — loading placeholder
- `FleetTopAppBar(...)` — consistent top bar

## Theme usage
```kotlin
// Colors — always from MaterialTheme
MaterialTheme.colorScheme.primary
MaterialTheme.colorScheme.surface
MaterialTheme.colorScheme.onSurface
MaterialTheme.colorScheme.errorContainer

// Typography
MaterialTheme.typography.titleLarge
MaterialTheme.typography.bodyMedium
MaterialTheme.typography.labelSmall

// Shapes
RoundedCornerShape(12.dp)  // cards
RoundedCornerShape(8.dp)   // chips, small elements
RoundedCornerShape(20.dp)  // dialogs
```

## Rules
- Reuse components from `ijs-ui-components-lib` before creating new ones
- Icons: `Res.drawable.ic_xxx` via `painterResource()`
- Strings: `Res.string.xxx` via `stringResource()` — no hardcoded text
- Consistent spacing: 4dp, 8dp, 12dp, 16dp, 20dp, 24dp increments
